WEBVTT

00:00:19.302 --> 00:00:21.638
Why is it that women lose
their decision-making abilities

00:00:21.638 --> 00:00:24.374
when it comes to shopping?

00:00:24.374 --> 00:00:26.877
What? We're here shopping
because you told me

00:00:26.877 --> 00:00:29.212
I should at least wear perfume, right?

00:00:29.212 --> 00:00:31.047
Be that as it may,

00:00:31.047 --> 00:00:34.217
we've been here for three
whole hours. At this rate,

00:00:34.217 --> 00:00:37.754
our date is going to end with
you still picking out perfume.

00:00:37.754 --> 00:00:41.892
I can't help it. I've never
worn perfume before.

00:00:41.892 --> 00:00:44.394
I don't know which one I should get.

00:00:44.394 --> 00:00:46.385
What do you think about this one?

00:00:48.899 --> 00:00:50.934
Oh, that smells good.

00:00:50.934 --> 00:00:56.106
Doesn't it? I think your boyfriend
will like this one too, Dr. Kitajima.

00:00:56.106 --> 00:00:59.041
Huh? Are you...

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:05.615
My name is Hoshi Nanami,
and I'll be working under you, Doctor.

00:01:05.615 --> 00:01:08.379
It's a pleasure to meet you, Senpai.

00:01:26.136 --> 00:01:31.875
In my younger days, I lost

00:01:31.875 --> 00:01:37.747
even the reason for this pain

00:01:37.747 --> 00:01:43.453
Crouching over, making excuses

00:01:43.453 --> 00:01:46.650
I must have...

00:01:48.058 --> 00:01:54.331
Taking hold of the premonition
I saw at the end of the blue,

00:01:54.331 --> 00:02:01.938
riding the wind, I'm off
to where the light shines

00:02:01.938 --> 00:02:04.808
I'll always be with you

00:02:04.808 --> 00:02:07.310
see the sky in front of you

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:11.679
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:02:13.483 --> 00:02:19.022
Riding the echo of swirling stars,

00:02:19.022 --> 00:02:21.691
I sing out

00:02:21.691 --> 00:02:30.360
May my voice reach you

00:02:43.046 --> 00:02:44.881
What is this?

00:02:44.881 --> 00:02:49.285
Why would you do
something like this? Tell me.

00:02:49.285 --> 00:02:51.014
Quiet.

00:02:52.989 --> 00:02:54.491
This is Nanami.

00:02:54.491 --> 00:02:58.361
I've taken over the cockpit,
right on schedule.

00:02:58.361 --> 00:03:01.965
Good work. Get ready
for us to collect the Album.

00:03:01.965 --> 00:03:03.557
Roger.

00:03:05.301 --> 00:03:10.040
That gun... don't tell me
you're with the Girouard.

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:12.142
I'm taking the Album.

00:03:12.142 --> 00:03:13.837
Nanami!

00:03:26.156 --> 00:03:29.692
How come?! I don't understand!

00:03:29.692 --> 00:03:32.562
Why aren't we allowed to mobilize?!

00:03:32.562 --> 00:03:34.998
Akira and Machina are our friends!

00:03:34.998 --> 00:03:37.434
Take it easy, Sigelinde.

00:03:37.434 --> 00:03:40.170
The commander has some sort of idea.

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:42.604
We just have to follow his orders.

00:03:46.109 --> 00:03:50.046
I'm sorry for lying about having
received special orders from you

00:03:50.046 --> 00:03:52.849
to get out of a tight spot, Commander.

00:03:52.849 --> 00:03:55.785
But I just wanted to get
Gio back, no matter what!

00:03:55.785 --> 00:04:00.690
Sometimes being able to act
impulsively is the prerogative of youth.

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:03.193
I'll overlook this incident.

00:04:03.193 --> 00:04:07.430
Refrain from acting on
your own from here on.

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:10.058
Yes sir, I'll be mindful.

00:04:11.367 --> 00:04:16.100
Then again, I don't dislike that attitude.

00:04:23.146 --> 00:04:24.781
In any event,

00:04:24.781 --> 00:04:28.979
we're to stand by here at our
current status. Understood?

00:04:39.329 --> 00:04:42.098
Well? See anything?

00:04:42.098 --> 00:04:46.236
Yes. The special forces unit
has sealed off the bridge.

00:04:46.236 --> 00:04:48.898
But Raina and the others
don't appear to be there.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:54.277
Which means, they want
to observe us, do they?

00:04:54.277 --> 00:04:58.481
- Observe?
- Lf they really meant to catch us,

00:04:58.481 --> 00:05:02.185
Raina and the others would be coming
after us, not the special forces, right?

00:05:02.185 --> 00:05:03.520
That makes sense.

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:07.023
Well, there's no sense in
staying here, so let's move on.

00:05:07.023 --> 00:05:09.287
I seem to remember a place.

00:05:16.699 --> 00:05:18.168
Here?

00:05:18.168 --> 00:05:22.372
Yep. It's been called a haunted house.

00:05:22.372 --> 00:05:25.441
A haunted house?

00:05:25.441 --> 00:05:26.676
I'm kidding, I'm kidding.

00:05:26.676 --> 00:05:31.114
When the new city was built,
everyone moved out of this whole area.

00:05:31.114 --> 00:05:34.015
And so, now, it's all vacant.

00:05:35.552 --> 00:05:37.954
All right, the lights work!

00:05:37.954 --> 00:05:40.047
The water seems to be running, too.

00:05:41.724 --> 00:05:43.555
Which means...

00:05:46.396 --> 00:05:50.389
Ah... that feels good...

00:05:58.141 --> 00:05:59.972
That was refreshing.

00:06:05.748 --> 00:06:08.683
Sorry! You're a guy, huh?

00:06:11.688 --> 00:06:14.324
So, what do we do now?

00:06:14.324 --> 00:06:19.062
There's no going back now
for me and Machina, huh?

00:06:19.062 --> 00:06:25.068
I want to see Toa. That's all I want.

00:06:25.068 --> 00:06:29.105
Yeah. I guess, for you, that's all you've got.

00:06:29.105 --> 00:06:31.908
Though, I might add...

00:06:31.908 --> 00:06:34.177
Hurry up and put your panties on.

00:06:34.177 --> 00:06:36.668
Whoops, I forgot.

00:06:58.868 --> 00:07:01.894
Farewell, Senpai.

00:07:08.311 --> 00:07:09.938
The Album!

00:07:16.753 --> 00:07:18.380
Why, that little...

00:07:21.391 --> 00:07:24.727
This is Kitajima! ISDA, please respond!

00:07:24.727 --> 00:07:27.457
This is Kitajima! Please respond!

00:07:32.302 --> 00:07:34.133
It's no use.

00:07:45.948 --> 00:07:47.779
Maybe over there.

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:22.685
Detached from submarine.

00:08:22.685 --> 00:08:26.348
Agathion 1, Agathion 2, all clear.

00:08:28.191 --> 00:08:30.293
How is the Album doing?

00:08:30.293 --> 00:08:32.729
She's still asleep.

00:08:32.729 --> 00:08:34.560
I see.

00:08:40.169 --> 00:08:44.307
Why didn't you finish them off?

00:08:44.307 --> 00:08:47.470
Was I given those orders?

00:08:50.413 --> 00:08:55.218
You're right. Well, I'll have to be
sure not to forget that next time.

00:08:55.218 --> 00:08:57.854
Major, we are ready to get underway.

00:08:57.854 --> 00:08:59.655
All right, move out.

00:08:59.655 --> 00:09:02.590
Acknowledged. Engaging Chariot.

00:09:22.578 --> 00:09:25.945
Just how long are they
planning to isolate us here?

00:09:31.721 --> 00:09:33.586
What's that?

00:09:38.027 --> 00:09:39.762
Have to...

00:09:39.762 --> 00:09:42.424
Have to contact the base at once!

00:09:47.703 --> 00:09:49.305
The Album...

00:09:49.305 --> 00:09:50.932
What?!

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:20.628
Tachibana Kazuki...

00:10:37.253 --> 00:10:39.312
Where am I?

00:10:53.002 --> 00:10:56.038
What?! The Album has been taken?!

00:10:56.038 --> 00:11:00.276
Yes. We just received an
emergency message from Dr. Kitajima.

00:11:00.276 --> 00:11:03.179
Hoshi Nanami was a Girouard spy.

00:11:03.179 --> 00:11:06.883
The control tower radar also picked up
a spaceship of unknown affiliation

00:11:06.883 --> 00:11:10.052
taking off from the sea
near Shin-Ogasawara.

00:11:10.052 --> 00:11:12.488
I don't think there can
be any doubt that it was

00:11:12.488 --> 00:11:14.891
a Girouard spaceship,
with the Album aboard.

00:11:14.891 --> 00:11:17.727
Understood. If anything
comes up, contact me.

00:11:17.727 --> 00:11:20.491
I'll be right there, after I stop by HQ.

00:11:32.575 --> 00:11:37.380
I'm going back to the base.
You go on ahead to bed.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.075
Okay.

00:11:54.096 --> 00:11:56.496
Ready, Otohime?

00:12:03.873 --> 00:12:05.704
Now!

00:12:35.271 --> 00:12:37.607
Magnificent, Otohime.

00:12:37.607 --> 00:12:40.042
Please do just as well
when we do it for real, okay?

00:12:40.042 --> 00:12:42.712
You can count on me, ltsuki.

00:12:42.712 --> 00:12:45.442
Okay, it's briefing time.

00:12:48.584 --> 00:12:51.887
Be sure to use plenty of caution
when handling the Type X,

00:12:51.887 --> 00:12:56.792
code name "Dragonslayer,"
that D Project will be using.

00:12:56.792 --> 00:13:00.329
This missile packs a great deal
of kick to it when launched,

00:13:00.329 --> 00:13:02.164
and even with your Dragon's abilities,

00:13:02.164 --> 00:13:05.001
it's difficult to maintain attitude control.

00:13:05.001 --> 00:13:08.104
Regardless of how great the missile's
destructive capability may be,

00:13:08.104 --> 00:13:10.906
unless you strike at the
center, where the core is,

00:13:10.906 --> 00:13:13.175
we cannot hope that it
will have much effect.

00:13:13.175 --> 00:13:15.778
Since we do not know
how an unknown life form

00:13:15.778 --> 00:13:21.751
like Thanatos will act, we must
be certain to hit it with one shot.

00:13:21.751 --> 00:13:24.453
Do not forget that.

00:13:24.453 --> 00:13:26.284
That is all.

00:13:36.465 --> 00:13:38.467
Sis...

00:13:38.467 --> 00:13:40.102
Oh, Yuya...

00:13:40.102 --> 00:13:41.470
It's almost time, huh?

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:42.938
Yes indeed.

00:13:42.938 --> 00:13:48.010
It's too bad. I sure did want to
be selected as a formal member

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:50.945
of the Vritra Unit, and be on the
strike team with you guys, Sis.

00:13:52.648 --> 00:13:54.016
That's encouraging.

00:13:54.016 --> 00:13:57.653
But if you did, you'd have
to work out some more.

00:13:57.653 --> 00:14:01.054
I-I do work out! Look!

00:14:04.126 --> 00:14:07.196
Sure. But first, you'll have
to go through Resonance,

00:14:07.196 --> 00:14:10.166
and obtain a partner of your own.

00:14:10.166 --> 00:14:11.997
Good luck!

00:14:15.237 --> 00:14:16.972
Yeah, she's right.

00:14:16.972 --> 00:14:20.703
I can't be a Dragonaut
without a Dragon, huh?

00:14:44.567 --> 00:14:48.037
Your Highness, the item you
are expecting has arrived.

00:14:48.037 --> 00:14:49.868
She's here?

00:14:58.914 --> 00:15:01.678
We bring you the Album.

00:15:05.521 --> 00:15:08.615
Well done, Nanami.

00:15:10.926 --> 00:15:12.757
Yes, sir.

00:15:31.714 --> 00:15:35.151
Oh, it is indeed the Album!

00:15:35.151 --> 00:15:40.456
Where am I? Where is
this place? Who are you?

00:15:40.456 --> 00:15:46.095
I am Asim, and this is my palace, on Mars.

00:15:46.095 --> 00:15:49.724
Mars?! Oh, no...

00:15:52.168 --> 00:15:59.597
I am here. Can you hear me?
I am here. Answer me, Mother.

00:16:01.744 --> 00:16:04.747
It's no use, I can't get through.

00:16:04.747 --> 00:16:08.184
Please, let me out of here, right now!

00:16:08.184 --> 00:16:10.586
Return me to Earth!

00:16:10.586 --> 00:16:14.323
Otherwise... otherwise,
something terrible will happen!

00:16:14.323 --> 00:16:15.991
Please!

00:16:15.991 --> 00:16:18.627
Sorry, but I can't do that.

00:16:18.627 --> 00:16:24.300
Never mind that,
I want to see your true form.

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:29.705
Would you mind showing
me all that you are?

00:16:29.705 --> 00:16:31.507
What do you?

00:16:31.507 --> 00:16:35.711
Come on, hurry up and show me, Album.

00:16:35.711 --> 00:16:38.347
- I have a message.
- What is it?

00:16:38.347 --> 00:16:41.784
A moment ago, a surveillance
satellite detected a Dragon

00:16:41.784 --> 00:16:45.521
of unknown affiliation headed
toward Earth from the Pluto region.

00:16:45.521 --> 00:16:46.956
A Dragon, you say?

00:16:46.956 --> 00:16:49.789
This is an image of Thanatos
from five hours ago.

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:57.399
We believe that this unidentified Dragon
is flying this way from Thanatos.

00:16:57.399 --> 00:17:01.961
Interesting. That would
mean a fourth Original, then?

00:17:11.247 --> 00:17:16.241
Jin, hurry and get out of there.
Earth is done for.

00:17:19.488 --> 00:17:24.026
Thanks for the other day.
We made it through, thanks to you.

00:17:24.026 --> 00:17:28.397
My, it is an honor to be given
such kind words of gratitude

00:17:28.397 --> 00:17:32.568
from the Lindworm Unit's ace pilot.

00:17:32.568 --> 00:17:34.236
Don't tease me.

00:17:34.236 --> 00:17:37.072
How about having dinner with me
sometime, so I can thank you?

00:17:37.072 --> 00:17:39.842
I'll treat you to whatever you like.

00:17:39.842 --> 00:17:42.711
I'm not getting my hopes up.

00:17:42.711 --> 00:17:46.582
That's not nice. I'm a man
who keeps his promises.

00:17:46.582 --> 00:17:49.685
Especially promises
made to beautiful women.

00:17:49.685 --> 00:17:52.745
My, aren't you the flatterer?

00:17:54.189 --> 00:17:56.058
What's wrong?

00:17:56.058 --> 00:17:58.083
I wonder what that is.

00:18:06.535 --> 00:18:07.803
Hey!

00:18:07.803 --> 00:18:10.439
What's the matter, Habaragi-kun?!

00:18:10.439 --> 00:18:12.975
- Habaragi-kun!
- Emergency alert!

00:18:12.975 --> 00:18:18.314
Lindworm Unit, please report to the
command center immediately! Repeat...

00:18:18.314 --> 00:18:20.582
Commander, we have an emergency alert!

00:18:20.582 --> 00:18:23.385
We've identified a hyperthermic
heat source on L-3 Base!

00:18:23.385 --> 00:18:25.621
It appears there's been
an accidental explosion!

00:18:25.621 --> 00:18:27.923
What?! Current status!

00:18:27.923 --> 00:18:30.059
We're checking on that now.

00:18:30.059 --> 00:18:31.961
Understood.

00:18:31.961 --> 00:18:34.630
Continue to collect information.

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:36.899
Roger!

00:18:36.899 --> 00:18:38.434
What happened?!

00:18:38.434 --> 00:18:40.803
It looks like there was
an explosion on L-3 Base.

00:18:40.803 --> 00:18:43.005
We're verifying that now.

00:18:43.005 --> 00:18:44.273
What?

00:18:44.273 --> 00:18:46.241
What happened?

00:18:46.241 --> 00:18:49.511
Apparently, there was
an explosion on L-3 Base.

00:18:49.511 --> 00:18:52.181
Is communication possible?

00:18:52.181 --> 00:18:55.184
No. I've been calling them this whole time.

00:18:55.184 --> 00:18:59.348
Commander, receiving an emergency
transmission from L-3 Base.

00:19:01.190 --> 00:19:04.093
- Oh, no!
- What is it?

00:19:04.093 --> 00:19:08.697
A Dragon of unknown affiliation
has attacked L-3 Base...

00:19:08.697 --> 00:19:11.166
Vritra Unit has been wiped out.

00:19:11.166 --> 00:19:13.157
What?

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:37.126
What in the world was that?

00:19:37.126 --> 00:19:38.787
Ltsuki!

00:19:40.396 --> 00:19:43.132
Otohime...

00:19:43.132 --> 00:19:45.067
Are you all right?

00:19:45.067 --> 00:19:48.670
Yes. What happened?

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:52.041
A Neo-Original hit us.

00:19:52.041 --> 00:19:55.210
This place won't hold together long.
Let's get out of here, quickly.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:59.681
N-No, we have to help the others.

00:19:59.681 --> 00:20:04.516
It's too late. This place is going
to explode any second. Hurry!

00:20:08.891 --> 00:20:11.553
H-Have to get out...

00:20:18.167 --> 00:20:19.930
What was that?

00:20:25.607 --> 00:20:28.371
A D-Dragon!

00:20:40.856 --> 00:20:43.086
Yuya! Everyone else!

00:20:45.594 --> 00:20:48.859
Yuya!!

00:21:05.881 --> 00:21:09.118
Commander, I've picked
up Otohime's pulse!

00:21:09.118 --> 00:21:10.886
Captain Habaragi is safe, too!

00:21:10.886 --> 00:21:12.054
You're certain?!

00:21:12.054 --> 00:21:15.421
They're entering the atmosphere.
I'm putting the image up.

00:21:19.228 --> 00:21:20.820
Habaragi-kun...

00:21:22.498 --> 00:21:24.728
What is that light?

00:21:26.301 --> 00:21:29.271
The unidentified Dragon
is closing in on Otohime!

00:21:29.271 --> 00:21:31.171
What?!

00:21:47.356 --> 00:21:49.187
Otohime?

00:21:53.462 --> 00:21:55.453
What is that?

00:22:07.509 --> 00:22:14.183
The moment our eyes met,

00:22:14.183 --> 00:22:20.989
I felt like the sadness was beginning

00:22:20.989 --> 00:22:27.663
The memories that can't be blotted out

00:22:27.663 --> 00:22:34.865
bind our hearts together, even now

00:22:36.705 --> 00:22:43.545
Though there are as many people

00:22:43.545 --> 00:22:46.548
as there are in these thousands of stars,

00:22:46.548 --> 00:22:50.419
you're the only one that I can see

00:22:50.419 --> 00:22:53.589
Though we may not be able to meet,

00:22:53.589 --> 00:22:56.525
and our wishes might not be granted,

00:22:56.525 --> 00:23:02.831
our growing feelings
are sure to last forever

00:23:02.831 --> 00:23:09.838
If fate tears the two of us apart,

00:23:09.838 --> 00:23:16.678
I believe that just meeting
each other was a miracle

00:23:16.678 --> 00:23:23.252
Look how it flows, like this rain

00:23:23.252 --> 00:23:29.291
I want to let all of my affection fall on you

00:23:29.291 --> 00:23:33.523
Rain of Love

00:23:43.238 --> 00:23:45.307
- Saki here!
- Megumi here!
- Ryoko here!

00:23:45.307 --> 00:23:50.279
And now, it's time for the ISDA
annual year-end tongue-twister contest!

00:23:50.279 --> 00:23:51.913
- Annual?
- Year-end?

00:23:51.913 --> 00:23:53.248
Huh? Am I wrong?

00:23:53.248 --> 00:23:54.816
You're wearing a summer
uniform, aren't you?

00:23:54.816 --> 00:23:56.218
I'm sensitive to the heat.

00:23:56.218 --> 00:23:57.919
Uh, we're almost out of time.

00:23:57.919 --> 00:24:00.589
Huh? Okay, we have to talk fast!
Okay, take it, Megumi-san!

00:24:00.589 --> 00:24:01.623
On the next Dragonaut:

00:24:01.623 --> 00:24:04.393
Shin-Ogasawara reels
when a giant Dragon appears!

00:24:04.393 --> 00:24:07.496
What will be the fate of Jin and Gio?!
And don't tell me he's one, too!

00:24:07.496 --> 00:24:09.327
That was fast!
